{"schema_version":"1.0.0","id":"cik-0001748137","cik":"0001748137","slug":"neovolta-748137","name":"NeoVolta Inc.","ticker":"NEOV","exchanges":["Nasdaq","Nasdaq"],"sector":"Miscellaneous Electrical Machinery, Equipment & Supplies","sic":"3690","country":"CA","website":"","listed_years":3.8,"first_annual":"2022-09-27","last_filing":"2026-06-12","annual_only":false,"edgar_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001748137&type=10-K","summary":{"sentences":["NeoVolta Inc. files with the SEC under \"Miscellaneous Electrical Machinery, Equipment & Supplies\", based in CA, and has been publicly reporting for 4 years.","It reported $15.3m of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 0.5% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 45.8%.","Listed on Nasdaq, Nasdaq, it is still consuming cash, with roughly 41 months of runway at the current burn."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Growth has been positive in 6 of the last 8 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1748137/000168316826003941/0001683168-26-003941-index.htm","accession":"0001683168-26-003941"},{"text":"Gross margin of 45.8% means most of each additional sale falls through to cover fixed costs.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1748137/000168316826003941/0001683168-26-003941-index.htm","accession":"0001683168-26-003941"},{"text":"Gross margin expanded from 25.5% to 45.8% against the same quarter a year earlier - the company is keeping more of what it sells, not buying growth with discounts.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1748137/000168316826003941/0001683168-26-003941-index.htm","accession":"0001683168-26-003941"},{"text":"Net cash of $10.9m against total assets of $25.7m - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1748137/000168316826003941/0001683168-26-003941-index.htm","accession":"0001683168-26-003941"}],"bear":[{"text":"Revenue grew only 0.5% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). Whatever the story is, it is not currently showing up in sales.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1748137/000168316826003941/0001683168-26-003941-index.htm","accession":"0001683168-26-003941"},{"text":"Growth is erratic - a standard deviation of 363.7% across 8 comparisons. Lumpy revenue usually means few customers or long contracts, and both make any single quarter a poor guide.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1748137/000168316826003941/0001683168-26-003941-index.htm","accession":"0001683168-26-003941"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-129.7% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1748137/000168316826003941/0001683168-26-003941-index.htm","accession":"0001683168-26-003941"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $1.3m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1748137/000168316826003941/0001683168-26-003941-index.htm","accession":"0001683168-26-003941"},{"text":"Diluted share count rose 20.0% over the year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). The company can grow while your share of it shrinks, and this is the number most commentary ignores.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1748137/000168316826003941/0001683168-26-003941-index.htm","accession":"0001683168-26-003941"},{"text":"Insiders disposed of 9.9% of their combined holdings over the last four quarters (500,000 shares across 14 ownership filings). People with the best view of the business were reducing their stake.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1748137/000168316826004803/0001